flowchart TD
 Request[Cookie plus CSRF] --> Session[Authenticate and check expiry]
 Session --> Scope[Owner or document grant SQL predicate]
 Scope --> Text[Authorized passages only]
 Text --> Rerank[Reranker and generator]
 Rerank --> Recheck[Recheck grants after inference]
 Recheck --> Response[Answer response]
 Citation[Citation or original request] --> SourceACL[Independent document authorization]
 SourceACL --> Source[Exact stored source]
